{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1,Gameplay Overview</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Legend of Zhaoyang (Demo)</i> adopts a visual novel-like format. Players simply follow on-screen instructions to progress through the game and experience the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2,Story Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first round, players travel to another world and become Crown Prince Xiao Jingzhao of the Zhaoyang Kingdom. They engage in a series of events with various NPCs within the palace grounds and ascend the throne in the fifth round.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the sixth round onward, players can explore all buildings on the city map and interact with more characters in simple ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3,Additional Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the sixth round, players can read books and practice astrology in the Imperial Study.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story includes a duel mechanic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4,Special Notes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses AI technology to generate storylines in real-time. Please wait 0.5\u20132 minutes before each new story segment begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently lacks complete background music and dialogue voice acting.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771330?t=1748936753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771330/4d0b492bbd46054e3149170ea6cc0e42b913ea7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748936753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771330/176d260e2ab51a22ba0568908d903b3e6dd3d8ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748936753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771330/176d260e2ab51a22ba0568908d903b3e6dd3d8ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748936753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1,Gameplay Overview</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Legend of Zhaoyang (Demo)</i> adopts a visual novel-like format. Players simply follow on-screen instructions to progress through the game and experience the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2,Story Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first round, players travel to another world and become Crown Prince Xiao Jingzhao of the Zhaoyang Kingdom. They engage in a series of events with various NPCs within the palace grounds and ascend the throne in the fifth round.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the sixth round onward, players can explore all buildings on the city map and interact with more characters in simple ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3,Additional Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the sixth round, players can read books and practice astrology in the Imperial Study.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story includes a duel mechanic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4,Special Notes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses AI technology to generate storylines in real-time. Please wait 0.5\u20132 minutes before each new story segment begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently lacks complete background music and dialogue voice acting.</p></li></ul>","developers":["A I. X-factor Play"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3705720","name":"\u662d\u9633\u4f20"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771330